				<wikidot:authorName>Zmax15</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2000203</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel kind of low for upvoting, I just find the idea of a cat typing expletives too enjoyable to toss it off the site. I will say that the translation reads kind of bizarrely, and doesn't fit that &quot;clinical tone&quot;, but I'm super alright with all that, pretty much just accepting that is is a translation. I just don't know what the objective level of quality for translations is, so I'm in favor because I like them.</p> 
				 	]]>
